        "is_free": false,
        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You need to clear out massive waves of super ultra-mega-hordes of monsters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each battle lasts about 15 minutes – perfect for quick sessions anytime!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3703380/extras/fca83ddafcbb5aee0ccdfb40bd1bd7d1.avif?t=1764228432\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3703380/extras_big/fca83ddafcbb5aee0ccdfb40bd1bd7d1.avif?t=1764228432 width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Warriors will automatically attack enemies. Each kill grants XP. When they level up, you'll get enhancement cards to strengthen your warriors!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3703380/extras/65e725c9d29b04d4801516e8ab220668.avif?t=1764228432\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3703380/extras_big/65e725c9d29b04d4801516e8ab220668.avif?t=1764228432 width=800 height=450 /></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Warriors have synergies – for example, if you unlock the &quot;Energy Sense&quot; ability, magic waves will trigger a ring of smaller magic waves upon contacting electromagnetic fields.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Relics drop during combat, and powerful ones will significantly boost your firepower.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3703380/extras/073b0a642cd224e50edcdede5df6f13c.avif?t=1764228432\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3703380/extras_big/073b0a642cd224e50edcdede5df6f13c.avif?t=1764228432 width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Monsters have specific weaknesses or traits. Exploiting these vulnerabilities allows more efficient elimination.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3703380/extras/9bf6c12e7113320aad836574e270ccfb.avif?t=1764228432\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3703380/extras_big/9bf6c12e7113320aad836574e270ccfb.avif?t=1764228432 width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Come and experience the battlefield in person!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You need to clear out massive waves of super ultra-mega-hordes of monsters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each battle lasts about 15 minutes – perfect for quick sessions anytime!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3703380/extras/fca83ddafcbb5aee0ccdfb40bd1bd7d1.avif?t=1764228432\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3703380/extras_big/fca83ddafcbb5aee0ccdfb40bd1bd7d1.avif?t=1764228432 width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Warriors will automatically attack enemies. Each kill grants XP. When they level up, you'll get enhancement cards to strengthen your warriors!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3703380/extras/65e725c9d29b04d4801516e8ab220668.avif?t=1764228432\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3703380/extras_big/65e725c9d29b04d4801516e8ab220668.avif?t=1764228432 width=800 height=450 /></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Warriors have synergies – for example, if you unlock the &quot;Energy Sense&quot; ability, magic waves will trigger a ring of smaller magic waves upon contacting electromagnetic fields.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Relics drop during combat, and powerful ones will significantly boost your firepower.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3703380/extras/073b0a642cd224e50edcdede5df6f13c.avif?t=1764228432\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3703380/extras_big/073b0a642cd224e50edcdede5df6f13c.avif?t=1764228432 width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Monsters have specific weaknesses or traits. Exploiting these vulnerabilities allows more efficient elimination.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3703380/extras/9bf6c12e7113320aad836574e270ccfb.avif?t=1764228432\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3703380/extras_big/9bf6c12e7113320aad836574e270ccfb.avif?t=1764228432 width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Come and experience the battlefield in person!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
        "short_description": "Ultra-massive hordes of monsters are invading! Select heroes, choose upgrades, collect relics, and strategically deploy skills to prevent the monsters from reaching the defensive line. Each match lasts 15 minutes.",
